ID: vr-75
Title: Coordinated eye gestures, audible yawn and sneeze, and ten composite idle actions
Status: DONE
Milestone: Thirty tool-owned idle actions with coordinated eyes and bounded local sound
Dependencies: vr-71, vr-74
Purpose:
  Owner feedback asks for eye movement during looking around, five new eye
  actions, audible loud yawn/sneeze, a three-times yawn choice weight and ten
  genuinely distinct composites using at least three facial movements.
Tasks:
  Extend the existing catalog/pose/one-clock layer, not a session scheduler.
  Compose deliberate idle eyes with either cursor mode; restore baseline.
  Add local bounded yawn/sneeze sound with level/mute controls and explicit
  audio-start errors. Speech, interaction, hide, sleep and cancellation stop it.
  Preserve default normal/immutable performance-only creation policy.
  Qualify isolated actual heads, document mechanisms/limits, sync tracking,
  preserve current settings during owned live promotion and commit/push.
Acceptance criteria:
  Thirty unique complete actions: original fifteen, five eye-focused and ten
  new composites with at least three independently animated facial fields.
  Looking around moves eyes in horizontal/vertical directions even when head
  cursor mode is selected, without changing user cursor preferences.
  Yawn/sneeze have synchronized local sound; yawn weight is three times the
  standard action weight, not a promise of exact wall-clock frequency.
  No new idle poller/model/inference/download; at most one short sound playing.
  Existing speech owns priority; mute/level and failure states remain visible.
  Waiting/performance sleep does no new automatic motion/audio work.
Completion evidence:
  idle-eyes-native-01:720real action/view cases, six models/four views/thirty
  actions. Actual shader gaze changes horizontal/vertical directions in both
  cursor modes, opposite lids close, neutral restores. No gesture GPU buffer/
  storage/upload/fetch changes; isolated waiting adds no frames/requests/audio.
  Actual local yawn PCM peak~0.9/RMS~0.468, advancing audio clock, one context
  and manager mute/cancel pass on every head. Two compact frame sheets reviewed.
  idle-eyes-audio-final-02: final Claire120cases, visible output failure/retry,
  actual face/voice preemption/cancel/neutral and manual inspection ownership.
  idle-eyes-policy-01: normal and performance-only Claire/four views each;
  performance sleep remains inactive with sounds enabled. All owned test
  resources stopped. Host-muted audio is not independent listening acceptance.
  Node9runner cases/HTTP9/book9 pass; extra actual lottery-cell regression
  verifies yawn takes three equal probability cells, each other action one.
  live-idle-eyes-01: at01:01IST only owned head305416 becomes309252, same
  manager306384. Normal policy/all old controls/appearance preserved, other
  sessions unchanged and eleven promoted source/test hashes match candidate.
  New sound controls default enabled/75%; no source media/CPU saving claim.
  Candidate idle-eyes-75 at e188149; shared pinned model/runtime junctions
  are not OS-enforced read-only. Separate profiles/caches/backends used.
Completion log:
  2026-11-22 - Register bounded owner feedback; protect normal live head while
